  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-gh-plugin",
      "text": "> **中文文档**：[README.zh-CN.md](./README.zh-CN.md)\n\nA [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) plugin that wraps the [GitHub CLI (`gh`)](https://cli.github.com) as model-callable tools."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it is",
      "text": "`dsh-gh-plugin` exposes GitHub operations to DSH agents: repositories, issues, pull requests, search, Actions, releases, and the GitHub API — all through structured JSON-backed tools."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Browser settings page **GitHub**: auth status, generic forms for every `gh_*` tool, confirmations, and JSON/text results.\n- Session **GitHub** view tab: profile, contribution heatmap, repository list with actions, inbox, and local/remote Git branches.\n- Auth status and login guidance.\n- Repository create/view/list/edit/delete with topic management.\n- Issue create/list/view/close/reopen/comment/edit.\n- Pull request create/list/view/merge/checkout/review.\n- Search repos/issues/prs/code.\n- Actions workflow/run views; release create/list/view.\n- Raw `gh api` tool for advanced use.\n- Dangerous operations require explicit confirmation."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use cases",
      "text": "- Ask the agent to list open issues and summarize them.\n- Create an issue or PR from a conversation.\n- Search GitHub for repositories matching a topic.\n- Check CI run status and logs.\n- Create a release with generated notes.\n\nSee [docs/用例目录/README.md](./docs/用例目录/README.md) for the full command/use-case/parameter catalog (Chinese)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Preconditions",
      "text": "- Node.js 22+, `dsh` CLI installed.\n- `gh` installed and authenticated (`gh auth login`)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install from GitHub",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile default add github:<owner>/dsh-gh-plugin"
    },
    {
      "section": "allowlist build in $DSH_HOME/profiles/default/pnpm-workspace.yaml if requested",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install locally",
      "text": "```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/<owner>/dsh-gh-plugin.git\ncd dsh-gh-plugin\ndsh plugin --profile default add .\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh --profile default"
    },
    {
      "section": "or: dsh web",
      "text": "```\nOpen the **GitHub** tab in a session for heatmap/repositories/inbox/branches, or **Settings → GitHub** to run every gh tool.\n\nExample prompts:\n- `Use gh_issue_list to list open issues in this repo.`\n- `Search GitHub for dsh-plugin repositories sorted by stars.`"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "```yaml\n- id: gh\n  name: dsh-gh-plugin\n  config:\n    ghBin: /usr/local/bin/gh"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "TDD is mandatory:\n```bash\npnpm install\nnpm test\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-gh-plugin",
      "text": "> **English README**：[README.md](./README.md)\n\n一个 [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) 插件，把 [GitHub CLI（`gh`）](https://cli.github.com) 封装为模型可调用的工具集。"
    },
    {
      "section": "它是什么",
      "text": "`dsh-gh-plugin` 把 GitHub 操作暴露给 DSH Agent：仓库、issue、PR、搜索、Actions、Release、GitHub API，全部通过结构化 JSON 工具调用完成。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 浏览器设置页 **GitHub**：认证状态、全部 `gh_*` 工具的动态表单、危险操作确认、JSON/文本结果展示。\n- 会话主视图新增 **GitHub** 标签页：个人资料、贡献热力图、仓库列表及操作、收件箱、本地/远程 Git 分支。\n- 认证状态与登录引导。\n- 仓库创建/查看/列表/编辑/删除，支持 topic 维护。\n- Issue 创建/列表/查看/关闭/重开/评论/编辑。\n- PR 创建/列表/查看/合并/检出/审查。\n- 搜索仓库/issue/PR/代码。\n- Actions workflow/run 查看；Release 创建/列表/查看。\n- 高级用 `gh api` 工具。\n- 危险操作默认需要显式确认。"
    },
    {
      "section": "用例",
      "text": "- 让 Agent 列出未关闭 issue 并总结。\n- 从对话中创建 issue 或 PR。\n- 搜索 GitHub 上匹配某主题的仓库。\n- 查看 CI 运行状态和日志。\n- 创建带自动生成说明的 release。\n\n完整命令/用例/参数目录见 [docs/用例目录/README.md](./docs/用例目录/README.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "前置条件",
      "text": "- Node.js 22+，已安装 `dsh` CLI。\n- 已安装并登录 `gh`（`gh auth login`）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "从 GitHub 安装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile default add github:<owner>/dsh-gh-plugin"
    },
    {
      "section": "如 pnpm 请求构建许可，请在 profile 的 pnpm-workspace.yaml 中 allowBuilds 后重试",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "本地安装",
      "text": "```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/<owner>/dsh-gh-plugin.git\ncd dsh-gh-plugin\ndsh plugin --profile default add .\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh --profile default"
    },
    {
      "section": "或：dsh web",
      "text": "```\n打开会话顶部 **GitHub** 标签查看热力图/仓库/收件箱/分支；打开 **设置 → GitHub** 执行全部 gh 工具。\n\n示例提示词：\n- `用 gh_issue_list 列出当前仓库未关闭的 issue。`\n- `搜索 GitHub 上 dsh-plugin 主题的仓库，按 stars 排序。`"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "```yaml\n- id: gh\n  name: dsh-gh-plugin\n  config:\n    ghBin: /usr/local/bin/gh"
    },
